{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach, check weight, lift, and perform task. Scan area otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = LiftObject    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
